      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:johnconst.penitence.budge:1-119",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲉⲣⲉⲡⲉⲧⲣⲟⲥ ⲛϧⲣⲏⲓ ϧⲉⲛϯⲁⲩⲗⲏ ⲁⲥⲓ ⲛϫⲉⲟⲩⲓ ⲛⲛⲓ**ⲃⲱⲕⲓ** ⲛⲧⲉⲡⲓⲁⲣⲭⲓⲉⲣⲉⲩⲥ .",
      "english": "As Peter was in the courtyard below, one of the maids of the high priest came,",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 14 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:14",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
